{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（26日）早上近8時，元朗錦田街市一名魚檔檔主報案，指返回開檔發現有魚不見了，懷疑被人偷去。 警方到場調查列盜竊，暫未有人被捕。</p><p>姓王檔主在場稱，後門沒有上鎖，確實損失的數量有待點算，暫時未能確定；初步估計約2,000元 。</p><figure><img alt=\"魚檔老闆感到無奈。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202569143333949440926015.jpeg/P7a-r0wNNmBsfJcA4O3PP3ars0oV6-6Yvw_Qrr8P0K4\"/><figcaption>魚檔老闆感到無奈。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><p>根據《香港法例》第210章《盜竊罪條例》第2條，任何人若無合法授權或合理辯解，而不誠實地挪用屬於他人的財產，意圖永久剝奪其財產所有權，即屬「盜竊」。一經定罪，最高可被判處監禁10年。</p><p>要構成盜竊罪，必須符合數個元素，包括財物屬於他人；行為人並未獲得授權；存有「不誠實」意圖；意圖永久剝奪他人對財物的權利。</p><figure><img alt=\"魚檔被偷走一批魚，剩下幾條出售。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202569140787875840267543.jpeg/tkHahsS7EpiltOj_ELWwSc9G7MqbEnZ53xnuId8Z7iE\"/><figcaption>魚檔被偷走一批魚，剩下幾條出售。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是錦田街市一個魚檔。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202569137948200960516294.jpeg/Ya3LL8ejTi6_5HzrXktoxR5nqbHlS39yjHfzRIx380Q\"/><figcaption>現場是錦田街市一個魚檔。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是錦田街巿。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202571364028911616460158.jpeg/Q43mnQfiDIzW4n2b0hRrGfdIdWiZcLmZKhKmcyoSpnM\"/><figcaption>現場是錦田街巿。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有數條魚被丟在地上。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202571366830837760926573.jpeg/4JTp715nWXBLLL2BTF1EMRC3YI8-P22F4PlYouD5WKI\"/><figcaption>有數條魚被丟在地上。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有數條魚被丟在地上。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261126/1202571369729232896493702.jpeg/G29BBpZkF0mHbbVspZAfqMJnsrqxzyMUduiFxXbohcU\"/><figcaption>有數條魚被丟在地上。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T03:19:46.421040+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":6,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:27:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:08:32.857738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:13:02.320621+00:00","content_hash":"5f52c1a2d6fecc4fce5ac40ecb3b3dc29f3c5193f4c59d685965837f3375e452","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}